{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["And those who remain shall be struck with the boils of Egypt." "<b>And with hemorrhoids.</b> They are what emerges in the hidden place, therefore ובעפולים is written, and it is from the root of ויבא אל העופל." "<b>And with scab.</b> So in the language of Ishmael." "<b>And with חרס.</b> Some say he will need potsherd like Job, and if it is with samekh, some say [it means] the stroke of the sun. The correct interpretation is that it is a name of an illness like those mentioned, and it has no cognate [in Scripture]."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:25:10.010179772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}